      "label": "Martial arts uniforms (gi)",
      "description": "The blue uniforms (gi) worn by the individuals are standard attire in many martial arts disciplines. Recognizing these as martial arts uniforms is necessary to understand the context of the scene. The uniform signifies the practitioner's affiliation with a martial art, which is central to the meme's joke about 'partial' practice.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
