      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general internet meme audience",
      "description": "The target community is internet users familiar with meme culture, particularly those who appreciate wordplay, irony, and visual humor. The meme relies on understanding the pun 'partial arts' and the contrast between the visual depiction of martial arts practitioners and the dismissive text. This audience likely includes individuals who engage with online humor, often appreciating absurdist or self-deprecating jokes, and may not be deeply familiar with the cultural or disciplinary seriousness of martial arts, allowing the joke to land without requiring specialized knowledge.",
